        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.8, marginTop: 24, textAlign: 'center' }}>Our thanks to Prof. Gao Bo for his careful guidance, to Wang Fuxiang and Cao Shutong for their collaboration, and to the course team for this learning opportunity.</Text>

        <Box style={{ width: 1040, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 10, padding: '18px 24px', marginTop: 24, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
